<p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/042V">Remark <span data-tag="042V">8.5.10.2</span>.</a> The Thompson groupoid $\mathrm{Dy}$ contains exactly two isomorphism classes: </p>
<p><ul>
<li><p>
The isomorphism class of the degenerate interval $[0,0] = \{  0 \} $, whose automorphism group is the trivial group. 
</p>
</li><li><p>
The isomorphism class of the unit interval $[0,1]$, whose automorphism group is the Thompson group $\operatorname{Aut}_{ \mathrm{Dy} }( [0,1] )$ of Definition <a data-tag="0428" href="/tag/0428">8.5.8.12</a>. 
</p>
</li>
</ul></p>
